INSERT INTO ACTIVITY (PLAYER_ID, EVENT_DATE, DEVICE_ID, GAMES_PLAYED) VALUES (2, '2023-01-02', 103, 1);

/*
Under these data, Q1 would join player 1’s two next-day records and sum the CASE expression to 2 for player 1 (while the denominator counts player 1 once), giving a retention contribution of 2 for that install date. In contrast, Q2 would count player 1 only once as retained. This demonstrates a discrepancy in the computed retention rate. However, note that under the current ACTIVITY schema (with PRIMARY KEY on PLAYER_ID and EVENT_DATE) such duplicate records are not allowed, so a valid counterexample cannot be constructed without relaxing that constraint.
*/

